From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 01:22:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Turn career listings into expand-in-place job
 descriptions

Each "Find your specialty" card was previously a single mailto link --
clicking anywhere on it immediately opened the user's email client.
Now the card itself is a toggle button: clicking it expands a job
description panel in place (requirements, soft skills), and only the
"Apply by email" link inside that panel actually opens the mail
client. Collapsing re-hides the panel from the accessibility tree
after its transition finishes so it's not keyboard-focusable while
closed.

Renamed "Analog IC Design Engineer" to "Custom Layout Engineer" and
filled in its JD plus Physical Design Engineer's JD from the flyer
content provided. Design Verification Engineer gets a placeholder JD
for now, to be filled in later.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
